Lake Tahoe, Kings Beach, CA (April 2023)

== About me
I am a PhD student in the Electrical Engineering department at Northeastern University, advised by Professor [https://robot.neu.edu/ Taskin Padir]. I am interested in optimization, control, and machine learning, currently with applications in autonomous driving and robotics. My PhD work is focused on algorithms for distributed control of vehicle platoons.

== Education
- Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - June 2024 (expected)
- M.S. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - Dec. 2021
- B.S. in Mechanical Engineering, University of Maryland, Aug. 2013 - Dec. 2017

